What remains for a fully axiom-free lattice (B-route forward plan):
construct 2g analytic loops generating H1's loop-period image — i.e.
discharge `PeriodGeneratingLoops` without the chosen witness (dissection /
branched-cover homology generators, or the Kirov B-4 residue-engine count).
That is the ONLY gap between the engine and an unconditional
DiscreteTopology/IsZLattice for the Forster-model lattice; the spanning
half is already unconditional (B-3).
